{"id":"1353293318050545664","identityId":"1242294789908504576","name":"漂泊者-女-气动","displayName":"漂泊者 · 女","romanizedName":"ROVER","description":"身世不明的共鸣者，拥有吸收一切声音的力量。 为了寻回记忆而踏上旅途。","resonanceName":"声之容器","gender":"女","origin":"未知","identity":"未知","affiliation":"未知","specialty":"","weapon":"迅刀","element":"气动","releaseVersion":"V2.2","cv":{"中文":"张若瑜","日文":"田中美海","英文":"Jane Jackson","韩文":"Song Ha Rim"},"avatar":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/newHead/aki/woman.png","width":500,"height":500,"fallbackUrl":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/608cd7adc67f4b6eb84857ff0ff4b74920251118.png"},"hero":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/2c634a1334c54f87b07bd9d75759550420250323.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},"poster":null,"artworks":[{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/cbf6255812884896a8ae65a1cf924ed720250323.png","label":"立绘","kind":"portrait","orientation":"desktop","width":719,"height":713},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/2c634a1334c54f87b07bd9d75759550420250323.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/d286e97b5ffd477c9e84211b5548270f20250323.png","label":"编队立绘 · 移动版","kind":"team","orientation":"mobile","width":1129,"height":1654}],"archives":[],"treasures":[],"stories":[],"outfits":[],"voices":[{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886345680637952","title":"闲趣1","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575675139274964.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886345776652288","title":"闲趣2","text":"它是我与这世界的连结，见证我所经历的一切。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575675152667662.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886346146205696","title":"闲趣3","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575675166272412.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886327888883712","title":"入队1","text":"路途还很遥远，继续前进吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575670894286342.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886327900528640","title":"入队2","text":"新的发现吗？","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575670896242343.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886328190390272","title":"入队3","text":"我想留在大家身边……从过去，一同迈向明天。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575670924119855.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886303619702784","title":"突破1","text":"世界……似乎变得更加清晰。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665099229446.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886303423025152","title":"突破2","text":"这股力量虽有些不可思议，却让我感到十分的安心。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665051181173.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886303377371136","title":"突破3","text":"我还需要更多的时间去了解、熟悉这陌生的世界。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665040257245.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886303661645824","title":"突破4","text":"又是新的旅途吗？新的声音，新的故事，还有……碎片般的记忆。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665090803683.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-9-0-1440886303411204096","title":"突破5","text":"陆止于此，海始于斯，我们的旅途还远未结束。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665043271889.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894778998366208","title":"普攻1","text":"狂风，化为利刃。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981036631672045.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894779094835200","title":"普攻2","text":"呼啸吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981036599569770.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894778788651008","title":"普攻3","text":"荡涤诸恶。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981036440186830.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894813704302592","title":"共鸣技能1","text":"风起。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981044867675980.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894813989515264","title":"共鸣技能2","text":"剑扬狂澜。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981044918794446.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894813653970944","title":"共鸣技能3","text":"诸邪尽斩。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981044813430162.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894814811598848","title":"共鸣技能4","text":"不义奸邪……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981045181328295.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894814857736192","title":"共鸣技能5","text":"皆当审判！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981045204488014.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894838463279104","title":"-共鸣解放1","text":"呼风，横断无垠！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981050820594489.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894839440551936","title":"共鸣解放2","text":"唤潮，裁决已至！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981051054149327.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894841005027328","title":"共鸣解放3","text":"我，即是风暴！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981051419167865.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1362894915413909504","title":"变奏技能","text":"风动浪随。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1744981069166333530.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886047709376512","title":"受击1","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575604106429786.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886047892987904","title":"受击2","text":"唔……找准时机。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575604135972611.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886047755792384","title":"受击3","text":"再来一次。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575604119498019.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886031179141120","title":"重伤1","text":"呼……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575600169220153.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886031137959936","title":"重伤2","text":"保持冷静。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575600161663396.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886031653097472","title":"重伤3","text":"最后的机会……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575600192997603.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886016210432000","title":"力竭1","text":"还不能……结束","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575596579696517.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886016071741440","title":"力竭2","text":"到极限了吗……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575596563802297.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440886016113201152","title":"力竭3","text":"声音在消逝……","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575596581667021.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885997620060160","title":"声骸异能召唤","text":"希望这个有用。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575592156760509.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885997616320512","title":"声骸异能变身","text":"声形合一。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575592157558007.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885978734047232","title":"变奏技能","text":"速战速决。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575587654407144.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885962565283840","title":"进战提醒","text":"交给我吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575583806435461.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885944876687360","title":"滑翔","text":"跟随风的方向。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575579584646507.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885944315867136","title":"钩锁","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575579450181639.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885944654389248","title":"感知","text":"旅途中总是充满惊喜。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575579465489803.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885944210731008","title":"冲刺","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575579438541053.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885945321738240","title":"纵跑","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575579642627975.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885922899472384","title":"获得补给1","text":"意外的发现。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575574272551621.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885922861723648","title":"获得补给2","text":"过去留存的证明。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575574206499971.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1353293318050545664-voice-10-0-1440885923331764224","title":"获得补给3","text":"珍惜好旅途中每一份收获。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575574308696858.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"}],"hasOutfits":false,"voiceCount":44,"isPreview":false,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.kurobbs.com/mc/item/1353293318050545664","fetchedAt":"2026-10-23T16:03:50.090Z","syncWarnings":["个性语音 · 日文：来源暂未提供音频","个性语音 · 英文：来源暂未提供音频","个性语音 · 韩文：来源暂未提供音频","战斗语音 · 日文：来源暂未提供音频","战斗语音 · 英文：来源暂未提供音频","战斗语音 · 韩文：来源暂未提供音频","来源暂未提供角色档案","来源暂未提供珍贵之物","来源暂未提供角色故事"],"wikiBadge":""}
